此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABF"},"evidence_scope":"corpus_and_native_table_mentions"},{"id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFAB","label":"劉福","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"福","mention_ids":["c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0170","c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0176"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0170","chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009","quote":"福"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0176","chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009","quote":"福"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009","quote":"故越衍侯吳陽前在漢，漢使歸諭餘善，餘善弗聽。及橫海將軍先至，越衍侯吳陽以其邑七百人反，攻越軍於漢陽。從建成侯敖，與其率，從繇王居股謀曰：「餘善首惡，劫守吾屬。今漢兵至，眾彊，計殺餘善，自歸諸將，儻幸得脫。」乃遂俱殺餘善，以其眾降橫海將軍，故封繇王居股為東成侯，萬戶；封建成侯敖為開陵侯；封越衍侯吳陽為北石侯；封橫海將軍說為案道侯；封橫海校尉福為繚嫈侯。福者，成陽共王子，故為海常侯，坐法失侯。舊從軍無功，以宗室故侯。諸將皆無成功，莫封。東越將多軍，漢兵至，棄其軍降，封為無錫侯。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji114-005","interpretation_note":"分支字元不表排行，依明示父系記載接線；未名世代以星號留空。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-114","chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0170","c-shiji-114-dongyue:m009-0176"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":1},{"source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["shiji-020-t1-r059-c06-m000","shiji-020-t1-r059-c06-m001"],"paragraph_ids":[],"table_cell_ids":["shiji-020-t1-r059-c06"],"passage_count":1},{"source_id":"table-witness-shiji-021","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id