善，自歸諸將，儻幸得脫。」乃遂俱殺餘善，以其眾降橫海將軍，故封繇王居股為東成侯，萬戶；封建成侯敖為開陵侯；封越衍侯吳陽為北石侯；封橫海將軍說為案道侯；封橫海校尉福為繚嫈侯。福者，成陽共王子，故為海常侯，坐法失侯。舊從軍無功，以宗室故侯。諸將皆無成功，莫封。東越將多軍，漢兵至，棄其軍降，封為無錫侯。"}]}],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r059","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r059-c06","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["國名","侯功","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初已後"],"row_year":null},{"id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c03","column":3,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"三。四年三月乙丑，侯劉福元年。","source_row":100,"source_column":4,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c03-m000","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"劉福","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本列封國、舊爵及東越用兵職掌，與本傳同人暫接；保留表內姓名及省稱，海常侯劉福不併海常侯蘇弘。","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-114","chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","source_revision":8735633,"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFAB","quote":"故越衍侯吳陽前在漢，漢使歸諭餘善，餘善弗聽。及橫海將軍先至，越衍侯吳陽以其邑七百人反，攻越軍於漢陽。從建成侯敖，與其率，從繇王居股謀曰：「餘善首惡，劫守吾屬。今漢兵至，眾彊，計殺餘善，自歸諸將，儻幸得脫。」乃遂俱殺餘善，以其眾降橫海將軍，故封繇王居股為東成侯，萬戶；封建成侯敖為開陵侯；封越衍侯吳陽為北石侯；封橫海將軍說為案道侯；封橫海校尉福為繚嫈侯。福者，成陽共王子，故為海常侯，坐法失侯。舊從軍無功，以宗室故侯。諸將皆無成功，莫封。東越將多軍，漢兵至，棄其軍降，封為無錫侯。"}]}],"table_id":"shiji-021","table_fragment_id":"shiji-021-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-021-t1-r099","table_cell_id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c03","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-021","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-021","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-021","source_revision":"2607037","source_header":["國名","王子號","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初"],"row_year":null},{"id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c05","column":5,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"四。五年，侯福坐酎金，國除。","source_row":100,"source_column":6,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c05-m000","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"福","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本列封國、舊爵及東越用兵職掌，與本傳同人暫接；保留表內姓名及省稱，海常侯劉福不併海常侯蘇弘。","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-114","chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","source_revision":8735633,"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p009","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFAB","quote":"故越衍侯吳陽前在漢，漢使歸諭餘善，餘善弗聽。及橫海將軍先至，越衍侯吳陽以其邑七百人反，攻越軍於漢陽。從建成侯敖，與其率，從繇王居股謀曰：「餘善首惡，劫守吾屬。今漢兵至，眾彊，計殺餘善，自歸諸將，儻幸得脫。」乃遂俱殺餘善，以其眾降橫海將軍，故封繇王居股為東成侯，萬戶；封建成侯敖為開陵侯；封越衍侯吳陽為北石侯；封橫海將軍說為案道侯；封橫海校尉福為繚嫈侯。福者，成陽共王子，故為海常侯，坐法失侯。舊從軍無功，以宗室故侯。諸將皆無成功，莫封。東越將多軍，漢兵至，棄其軍降，封為無錫侯。"}]}],"table_id":"shiji-021","table_fragment_id":"shiji-021-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-021-t1-r099","table_cell_id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c05","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-021","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-021","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-021","source_revision":"2607037","source_header":["國名","王子號","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初"],"row_year":null},{"id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c01","column":1,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"城陽共王子。","source_row":100,"source_column":2,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-021-t1-r099-c01-m000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"城陽共王","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"同列父系欄記城陽共王子；據齊悼惠世家章之子喜與東越篇福父成陽共王接同人，不與吳王濞父代王喜混同。","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p033","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_revision":5977113,"person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA","quote":"城陽景王章，齊悼惠王子，以朱虛侯與大臣共誅諸呂，而章身首先斬相國呂王產於未央宮。孝文帝既立，益封章二千戶，賜金千斤。孝文二年，以齊之城陽郡立章為城陽王。立二年卒，子喜立，是為共王。"},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p034","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_revision":5977113,"person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ABFA","quote":"共王八年，徙王淮南。四年，復還王城陽。凡三十三年卒，子［建］延立，是為頃王。"}]}],"table_id":"shiji-021","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-021","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-021","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-021","source_revision":"2607037"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-114","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","source":{"title":"史記／卷114","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷114","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷114&oldid=8735633","revision_id":8735633,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定數位見證11段正文，沒有索隱述贊。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去header2、現代節標題與YL模板外殼，紀年及正文原字保留，未核底本影像。","note":"太史公曰仍屬正文，未補此見證未載的索隱述贊。"}}},{"chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source":{"id":"table-witness-shiji-020","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷020","revision_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷020&oldid=2607036","revision":"2607036","accessed":"2026-10-13","response_sha256":"f3fb3f9b7ead59e58f522014810ad9faf46b4723ba0b65f6175d72422aa6e0f8","edition":null,"image_verified":false,"rights":"古籍正文公有領域；維基文庫數位轉錄依CC BY-SA，保留貢獻者署名。","rights_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/Wikisource:版權信息","review_status":"partial_named_entity_review","note":"各組表保留原欄題、原文、空格及合欄，不推不同欄題的接續。西元欄為數位編者增補；未明年份留空，不推世系曆年。未核底本影像，人物標註仍待逐處覆核。"}},{"chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-021","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-021","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-021","source":{"id":"table-witness-shiji-021","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-021","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-021","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷021","revision_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷021&oldid=2607037","revision":"2607037","accessed":"2026